{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13222460","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13222460","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1322246001:1":{"text":"여러분 덕분에 큰 일이 벌어지기 전에 막을 수 있었어요.","source_cn":"还好有你们及时阻止，不然后果不堪设想。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAF4634A3CB9EC950","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1322246002:1":{"text":"궁지에 몰린 이교도들이 살아있는 시체를 제물로 사용하기 시작했어요. 이런 심각한 상황에서는 노력조차 쉽지 않은 일이지요.","source_cn":"这些邪教徒走投无路，已经开始用活死人献祭了。情况本就严...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x605DE1A071397723","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1322246003:1":{"text":"화이트마운틴의 모두를 위해 힘써주셔서 정말 감사합니다.","source_cn":"谢谢你们为白山的大家所做的一切。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3D1DBDD81F6C0204","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:卡列琳娜":{"text":"캐롤라이나","source":"卡列琳娜","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":1}}